## Triage: compare causes, not subjects

The accepted [decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject) is a historical record, not a safe present rule. Its [triage page](/kb/triage/dedupe) has not been reviewed since 2024. Equal subjects can describe different causes; different subjects or channels can describe the same cause. Missing tenant configuration means unplaced, not automatically duplicate.

<DedupeExplorer />

The [proposed replacement decision](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-cause) leaves the accepted record intact. The desk must approve that change; this review does not silently mark it accepted.

## Closing criteria

Verify each fix separately, retain report-to-ticket membership, review the exceptional symptoms, refresh the export, and rebuild this page. Count each report ID once. Preserve both the written explanation and the rendered page so the desk can inspect the evidence behind the numbers.

